He listened to what we were saying. If everyone listened to the brilliant words of Brainy Smurf, the world would be a smurfier place.

00:46:37.640 --> 00:46:39.900
Are you spreading a little of your Christmas spirit, Sasa?

00:46:40.430 --> 00:46:42.730
Here, let me help you back into bed.

00:46:43.310 --> 00:46:46.010
But what about him? Are you pressing charges?

00:46:46.760 --> 00:46:49.660
No, I've gotten my gold back.

00:46:50.190 --> 00:46:52.670
And after all, it is Christmas Eve.

00:46:53.260 --> 00:46:55.060
Your house looks so lovely.

00:46:55.470 --> 00:46:57.090
Thanks to those elves.

00:46:57.980 --> 00:46:59.980
You must meet them. They're high.

00:47:00.320 --> 00:47:01.320
Under my bed.

00:47:02.670 --> 00:47:03.090
Good.

00:47:08.450 --> 00:47:09.190
It's better.

00:47:09.550 --> 00:47:12.110
Smurf-a-tootie, I have a feeling she'll be all right now.

00:47:13.730 --> 00:47:18.400
Looks like Wild Smurf will never forget his first Christmas.

00:47:18.640 --> 00:47:20.720
And I haven't forgotten all of you.

00:47:20.980 --> 00:47:25.260
I just happen to have a few dozen yuletide potations left.

00:47:26.800 --> 00:47:28.230
All right.

00:47:28.440 --> 00:47:29.350
All right.

00:47:29.630 --> 00:47:29.910
Maybe next.

00:47:30.190 --> 00:47:30.510
All right.
